         perex=('For selling a motorcycle, scooter or quad bike between private persons in Latvia. The same checked text as for a car; the change of owner is done in e-CSDD.' if moto else
                'For selling a used car between private persons in Latvia. The change of owner is done in e-CSDD; the agreement records the price, condition, payment and exact handover time.'),
         obsahPopis='Articles on the sale and handover of the vehicle.',
