          ('Condition of the vehicle',['The mileage on the day of signing is {{km}} km. The Seller is not aware of the odometer having been replaced or its readings altered.',{'uvodVzor':'Known defects (tick one option):','moznosti':{'nav':'The Seller is not aware of any defects of the vehicle.','ir':'The Seller has informed the Buyer of the following defects of the vehicle: {{defekti_apraksts}}'}},'The Buyer confirms that they have inspected the vehicle, know its condition and buy it in its existing condition.']),
          ('Price and payment',['The price of the vehicle is **{{cena}}** (in words: {{cena_vardiem}}).',{'uvodVzor':'Payment method (tick one option):','moznosti':{'skaidra':'The Buyer paid the price in cash on signing the agreement. By signing, the Seller confirms receipt of the full amount.','banka':'The Buyer will pay the price to the Seller’s bank account IBAN {{iban}} no later than {{samaksas_termins}}.'}}]),
          ('Handover of the vehicle',['The Seller hands over the vehicle to the Buyer on {{predavane_datum}} at {{predavane_ora}}, together with {{atslegas}} keys, the registration certificate and the other documents of the vehicle.','On handover, the risk of accidental loss of or damage to the vehicle passes to the Buyer. From that moment the Buyer is responsible for the use of the vehicle, in particular for traffic offences.']),
          ('Change of owner',['The parties will complete the change of owner in e-CSDD or at a CSDD customer service centre: the Buyer makes a mark that they wish to acquire the vehicle and the Seller approves it no later than 5 days after the handover. The Buyer registers the change of owner in their name within 5 days of the approval.','The fee for registering the change of owner is paid by the Buyer unless the parties have agreed otherwise. The Seller confirms that the vehicle operation tax for the current year has been paid or will be paid before the change of owner is registered. The Buyer takes out OCTA insurance before using the vehicle.']),
